{"name": "Shrouded Siege", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this roguelike tower defense strategy game, you'll build labyrinths to defend shrines hordes of enemies. Every maze is a tactical puzzle. Leylines supercharge your towers, bogs mire down your enemies, and heavy fog turns the battle map into a mystery. With some help from the ancient gods of Ireland, you can mix and match divine boons among your towers to obliterate enemies with devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features multiplayer co-op with up to 4 people, with collaborative planning tools so you and your friends can argue about maze layouts in real time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/f9e6206be3a5ff3a5e444be602da0c42.avif?t=1786734222\" width=\"1200\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send enemies into bogs, chop down trees, and create new paths to build the most diabolical maze possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/b1d2bc84dbabc4b4306b62da20b83b18.poster.avif?t=1786734222\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/b1d2bc84dbabc4b4306b62da20b83b18.webm?t=1786734222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/b1d2bc84dbabc4b4306b62da20b83b18.mp4?t=1786734222\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/a0d9b1a13cd9dcc51817b5557ec673a6.avif?t=1786734222\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine 50+ abilities across 30+ towers using 30+ artifacts. Discover unique synergies with critical strikes, attack speed, high damage, special statuses, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/e17d81bda87216863c655adb678a508a.poster.avif?t=1786734222\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/e17d81bda87216863c655adb678a508a.webm?t=1786734222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/e17d81bda87216863c655adb678a508a.mp4?t=1786734222\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine these abilities with places of power and terrain synergies to build powerful combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"542\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/5e6dde509c0067c6400c533c20b10532.poster.avif?t=1786734222\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/5e6dde509c0067c6400c533c20b10532.webm?t=1786734222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/5e6dde509c0067c6400c533c20b10532.mp4?t=1786734222\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/96bd7d79fd5e82113c13c4e8cff7cf38.avif?t=1786734222\" width=\"1200\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shrouded Siege was designed for up to 4 players with collaborative tools to plan your mazes, coordinate builds, and buff each other\u2019s towers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/880f81500522b464a64ef201d5a8ca29.avif?t=1786734222\" width=\"1200\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30+ handcrafted maps are randomized slightly each run to keep them familiar but fresh. Bogs, forests, lava, cliffs, stone, sand, and more affect towers and enemies alike, with special tiles that mix things up even further for endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"334\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/2ef2df411eb2210e134bfa3f2bf7e983.poster.avif?t=1786734222\" width=\"592\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/2ef2df411eb2210e134bfa3f2bf7e983.webm?t=1786734222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/extras/2ef2df411eb2210e134bfa3f2bf7e983.mp4?t=1786734222\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes two of five playable characters. The second campaign, boss battle, signature endgame towers, and additional maps are available in the full game.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Design dastardly mazes in this co-op roguelike tower defense set in Irish mythology. Combine divine boons to make unstoppable towers and sculpt the terrain to make the ultimate death traps for your enemies.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827200/93707a8e612df11e924c4f7bbf8494a3719778f6/header.jpg?t=1786734222", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Co-op", "Tower Defense", "Roguelite", "Co-op Campaign", "Strategy", "Online Co-Op"], "developers": "Larus Ludens", "publishers": "Larus Ludens", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3827200", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "31 October 2025 - Request Access\n\n4 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/NtNHrnkwHgA", "first_seen": 1761865200.0, "review_rank": 1430}